Shader model 1 samplers (implicit type, e.g. Call of Duty 2 menus): own bindings for the
3D, cube and cube depth-compare variants, which Metal cannot alias with the 2D ones
(MSL "undeclared identifier s0_3dSmplr/s0_cubeSmplr/s0_cube_shadowSmplr").
